# Optional. The checks use the public endpoints when these are unset.
# Export them in the shell, or pass them inline: ELYSIUM_RPC_URL=... npm run elysium

# Elysium testnet. Used by scripts/chains.ts and `npm run elysium`.
# ELYSIUM_RPC_URL=https://testnet-rpc.elysium.kinetiq.xyz

# HyperEVM mainnet. Used by `npm run khype`.
# Unset means viem's default for chain 999 (https://rpc.hyperliquid.xyz/evm).
# HYPEREVM_RPC_URL=https://rpc.hyperliquid.xyz/evm
